## Conference Presentations

### OWASP Global AppSec USA 2026

**When Nobody Wrote the Code: Engineering Lessons from Building AI-Native Application Security**

San Francisco, California · November 2026

As AI agents increasingly generate, review, and modify software, how do we verify and trust their outcomes?

This presentation explores lessons from building AI-native application security workflows, including vulnerability discovery, remediation, security automation, and the engineering failures encountered along the way.

Topics include agent reliability, incomplete fixes, context limitations, evidence preservation, and the role of human judgment.

